OL,3,GNEWSAInjunction to stop building at
OL,4,Acountryside spot
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn injunction preventing further
OL,7,Funauthorised development on a patch of
OL,8,Fopen countryside has been granted at
OL,9,Fthe High Court.
OL,11,FWest Berkshire Council said it applied
OL,12,Ffor the injunction against 29 people or
OL,13,Fcompanies following recent breaches at
OL,14,FSouthway Plantation in Maidenhatch,
OL,15,Fnear Pangbourne.
OL,17,FThe two-year injunction, which allows
OL,18,F10 caravans to remain on the site, will
OL,19,Fremain in place until 19 October 2028
OL,20,Funless it is varied or discharged by
OL,21,Fthe court, the authority said.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
