OL,3,GNEWSAInjunction to stop building at
OL,4,Acountryside spot
OL,5,
OL,6,FDenise Gaines, its portfolio holder for
OL,7,Fplanning, said it has a duty to "ensure
OL,8,Fthat development takes place in
OL,9,Faccordance with planning law."
